        "basis": "site",
        "note": "NACO lists a government ART centre at KEM, Parel. Endocrinology (first floor, multi-storeyed building) treats adults and children; Diabetes OPD and Diabetes Foot Clinic Mon, Tue, Fri (new patients) and Sat 08:30–10:30. Children's diabetes isn't named specifically (the department lists a Puberty and Growth Clinic). Psychiatry runs a Child Guidance Clinic (Mon and Sat 09:00) but doesn't mention ADHD. Government ART centre under NACO. NACO's 2021 guidelines say people living with HIV get free diagnostics and free first-, second- and third-line ART at these centres; they don't say whether non-Indian nationals are covered, so call or visit in OPD hours to ask."
